				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "### System Interface\n{{gtClass:TheHub}} is a starting point for *Tactical-Tools* to connect into the rest of the system at a macro level. It doubles as an *interface* defined between tools and the underlying system that can be adapted to other Smalltalk environments [Pharo](https://pharo.org),  [Squeak](https://squeak.org)  or [Cuis](https://cuis.st) should the code ever be ported elsewhere."
			},
